# The compact source packs, staged from the coupled host checkout before packing.
#
# NOT committed, because the committed deliverable is the archives under dist/ -
# one zip per pack, which is the shape the game's installer fetches and verifies.
# Committing the loose files as well would be the same bytes twice, kept in step
# by hope. `node tools/pack.mjs --verify` is what proves the archives match a
# fresh conversion, and CI runs it on every push.
sources/
.claude/
node_modules/
package-lock.json
